<h1>Who is Enya? Biography and profile</h1>

<p><strong>Eithne Pádraigín Ní Bhraonáin</strong> (anglicised as <strong>Enya Patricia Brennan</strong>) was born on <strong>17 May 1961</strong>.</p> 

<p>Known professionally as <strong>Enya</strong>, she is a legendary Irish singer, songwriter, record producer, and musician.</p>

<p>With an estimated <strong>80 million albums sold worldwide</strong>, she ranks as the best-selling Irish solo artist in history, second only to the band <strong>U2</strong>.</p>

